mn (which is characterized by changing or falling leaves).\n- The clothing worn (light jackets, long sleeves) suggests **mild to cool temperatures**, possibly **spring or early fall**, but **not autumn** as defined by visual leaf color change.\n- Since the trees are fully green and no autumnal indicators are present, **autumn is not supported**.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\n✅ **Answer ‘0’ (Autumn) is INCORRECT.**\n\nThe visual evidence points more toward **spring or early summer**, given the green foliage and transitional clothing. If forced to choose from the provided options, **‘0’ (Autumn)** does not match the visual data.\n\n**Correct seasonal classification based on evidence: Not Autumn.**'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0137.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0138.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0139.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0140.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0141.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0142.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0143.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0144.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0145.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0146.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0147.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0148.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0149.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0150.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0151.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0152.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/v