y Autumn.*\n\n---\n\n#### 2. **Trees / Foliage**:\n- **Frames 22–24 (airport interior)**: Show **indoor potted palm trees and green plants** — **no outdoor trees visible**.\n- **Frames 25–30 (train station platform)**: Show **modern architecture, glass, steel, and distant city buildings** — **no visible trees at all**.\n- **No outdoor scenes with trees showing green leaves, changing colors, or bare branches.**\n\n❌ *No visual evidence of autumn foliage or bare branches.*\n\n---\n\n#### 3. **Weather indicators**:\n- **No umbrellas or rain gear** visible.\n- **No visible breath in cold air**.\n- **No snow or ice**.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nWhile the **clothing suggests a cool, transitional season** (which *could* be autumn), **there is no definitive visual evidence of autumn characteristics** such as:\n- Changing leaf colors\n- Bare trees\n- Mild weather cues specific to autumn (like harvest decor, fall festivals, etc.)\n\nMoreover, **the setting is almost entirely indoors or in modern transportation hubs** — which are climate-controlled and do not reflect outdoor seasonal conditions.\n\n### Therefore:\n> **The answer '0' (Autumn) is NOT verifiably correct based on the visual evidence in these 30 frames.**\n\nThere is **insufficient evidence** to confirm the season as Autumn. The clothing *could* suggest it, but without supporting environmental cues (like trees or outdoor weather), we cannot confidently assign the season.\n\n✅ **Final Answer: 0 (Autumn) is NOT correct based on available visual evidence.**"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0201.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0202.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0404.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0405.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_0406.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_p