mn (when trees typically still have leaves, often changing color).\n\n---\n\n#### ❌ **5. People using umbrellas or rain gear**  \n- **No umbrellas or rain gear** visible in any frame.\n\n---\n\n#### ❌ **6. People showing visible breath in cold air**  \n- **No visible breath** in any frame — suggests **not cold enough** for winter or late autumn.\n\n---\n\n### Additional Observations:\n\n- **Red lanterns** in **Frames 1–2** are often associated with **Chinese New Year (late winter/early spring)**, not autumn.\n- The **sky is clear and bright blue** in outdoor shots — suggests **sunny, mild weather**.\n- The **vlogger’s t-shirt** (Frame 29–30) strongly suggests **warm or temperate weather**, inconsistent with autumn in most parts of China (which typically requires long sleeves or light jackets).\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThere is **no visual evidence supporting autumn** (changing leaves, transitional clothing, mild but cooling temps). Instead, the evidence points toward **late winter or early spring** — bare trees, clear skies, light clothing, and festive red lanterns.\n\n> ✅ **Answer: ‘0’ (Autumn) is INCORRECT.**  \n> The season depicted is **more likely early spring**, not autumn.'}, {'batch_start': 150, 'batch_end': 180, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1966.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1967.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1968.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1969.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1970.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1971.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1972.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1973.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/frames/frame_1974.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wgBlACG927Y/fra